{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47621","headline":"赠江州太平观道士 · 吕岩","name":"赠江州太平观道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落魄薛高士，年高无白髭。\n云中闲卧石，山里冷寻碑。\n夸我饮大酒，嫌人说小诗。\n不知甚麽汉，一任辈流嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}